# A short tour of the script language, run by ctest run_display_headless and named in
# run/src/display/headless/README.md. Plain ticks only, so it does not depend on game.tick_hz.
0    screenshot start.png
2    key w down
+3   move 60 -40           # tick 5
5    screenshot moved.png  # shows tick 5's input, even that on the lines below
5    button left down
12   key w up
+0   button left up
12   wheel 4
+2   screenshot            # tick 14, as tick_00000014.png
+1   end
